7797_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A2CGOSkKITgQ7kNvwEzcnQ6&_nc_oc=Adq9dc-tOI4_NB4GzFsH-LKSuO6X083QuI_CJk4lnRB9GOZhnNrCi5w9Ya41avMonkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1aPeCwDb_fWW1W1hMd8KL4ON7Nl8gY2Sz6V8mmxKyHPw&oe=69F0CA06"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "26143231335310768", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585819904_26143231348644100_4706414489069474771_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-wehzKx3VcQ7kNvwE_HvjS&_nc_oc=AdpqIW4H_AeofA0GGPNSeP4AtCCW1xYOKX-Df4IRvuuqgT0e4YQXO1aSP_VL2oPiUf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af11BWmRhkKFSO6-bQ1_I7HHY8bp908tY7fQptfCkOBpJQ&oe=69F0CA3D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coverart.png", "id": "1248867616669768", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585741071_1248867620003101_4232653470607510738_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xYd2d0BRe8Q7kNvwGml1h-&_nc_oc=Adq0A9t5GHnkNLGIiOg3aikEOA_FPFad8P3-wJdKSAVd5zPYc0K47GqxfuWjalJ7HSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1qCs4llZLihEOFxjiahsInAzFE4YzVRmYUyHZkCBzuSw&oe=69F0ACBF"}, "display_name": "Arctic Expedition: Physics Sandbox", "keywords": ["Aviation", "AnimalRescue", "PhysicsSandbox", "ArcticExpedition", "FamilyAdventure"], "long_description": "**Embark on the ultimate Arctic Expedition!** Discover three expansive frozen islands in a high-density physics sandbox built for infinite discovery. \nWhether you are mastering high-altitude aviation or embarking on heartwarming animal rescue missions, every inch of this stunning low-poly wilderness is yours to explore.\n{906007749081496} \n\n**SKY-HIGH DISCOVERY:**\n\nTake command of the frozen skies with realistic flight mechanics.\n\n- **Glider Exploration:** Master wind currents with hang-gliding physics.\n- **Aerial Transport:** Pilot automated biplanes to uncover hidden islands.\n{1459649208923981} \n{1225639122992337} \n\n**PROTECT THE WILD:**\nExperience the emotional heart of the Arctic. Locate, free, and nurture creatures trapped in the wilderness.\n- **Nurturing Gameplay:** Identify wildlife in distress and earn rewards for the successful rescue.\n{949699051055866} \n\n\n**TOTAL INTERACTIVE FREEDOM:**\n \nFrom bungee jumping off ridges to ice fishing and mountain climbing, every object from bonfires to treasure chests is fully interactive.\n\n- **Emergent Play:** High-engagement activities including ropeway travel and rigid-body physics interactions.\n- **Vibrant Discovery:** A stylized, safe environment perfect for explorers of all ages.\n{1704570960951475} \n{1270672331642732} \n{1813631812645499} \n{1653635189382887} \n{1436335421378898}\n\n**SAFE & SEAMLESS:**\n- **Global Leaderboards:** Compete for the best times and exploration scores.\n- **Intuitive Design:** Gentle guidance and clear icons ensure a seamless experience for family-friendly play.\n{2108308573299674} \n\n\n**Note:** This title is in Early Access. Content and features are actively being expanded.\n\n", "short_description": "Embark on the ultimate Arctic adventure! Fly across jagged peaks, traverse deep canyons on a mechanical ropeway, and save a colony of penguins from mysterious visitors. Whether you're roasting treats under the aurora borealis or meeting Santa in his magic sleigh, our physics-driven sandbox offers endless, joyful exploration for the whole family. Discover a living world where every jump defies gravity.\n\nEarly Access: Help us refine the adventure and uncover new frosty mysteries!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://giocostudio.com/giocoapps/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gioco Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://giocostudio.com/giocoapps/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topic